[00:10.36]1. From house to house, from door to door,
[00:15.32]Jehovah’s word we spread.
[00:20.73]From town to town, from farm to farm,
[00:25.15]Jehovah’s sheep are fed.
[00:31.39]The good news that God’s Kingdom rules,
[00:35.95]As Jesus Christ foretold,
[00:40.99]Is now declared throughout the earth
[00:46.19]By Christians young and old.
[00:56.64]2. From house to house, from door to door,
[01:01.73]Salvation we proclaim.
[01:06.82]It comes to those who make the choice
[01:12.00]To call upon God’s name.
[01:16.00]But how can they respect the name
[01:21.00]Of One they do not know?
[01:27.45]To ev’ry home and ev’ry door,
[01:32.45]The sacred name must go.
[01:45.60]3. So let us go from door to door
[01:50.60]To spread the Kingdom news.
[01:55.60]And whether it’s embraced or not,
[02:00.60]We’ll let the people choose.
[02:05.95]At least we’ll name Jehovah’s name,
[02:10.99]His glorious truth declare.
[02:16.03]And as we go from door to door,
[02:21.39]We’ll find his sheep are there.